WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:03.850
My first Junior Youth match 
in the Maiami Championship

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:08.680
was the first official battle 
between Pendulum users.

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:14.970
Sawatari and I used all 
our strength in battle.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.370
He did it!

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:27.370
I believed that this was the 
duel that I was yearning for.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.570
I did entertainment dueling like 
my dad to make everyone smile.

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:39.080
Maybe I've gotten a little 
closer to my dad's level.

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:50.030
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:55.120
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:58.100
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:02.370
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:05.100
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.770
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:10.600
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:21.690
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:27.160
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:32.790
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:36.900
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:40.840
Repeating Up/Down

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:43.200
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:50.450
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:53.910
Because I don't want to give up

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:58.890
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:05.990
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:16.500
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:19.180
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:21.880
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:24.680
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:27.450
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:37.000
Neo Heartland City

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:40.820
The Pendulum battle was incredible!

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:43.080
I still can't stop shaking!

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:45.480
Me too!  Dueling is the best!

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:49.240
If the first match was this exciting, 
what's going to happen next?

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:52.420
That Pendulum Summon was incredible!

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:55.400
This year's tournament is too amazing!

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.110
You're right!

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:00.390
Next up is today's third match!

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:06.600
You Show School's Sora Shiunin vs 
Leo Duel School's Syun Kurosaki!

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:11.360
Welcome these two duelists 
with your applause!

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:14.140
Sora!

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:16.010
Win!  Like Yuya and I did!

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:17.660
LDS...

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:18.980
Beat them!

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:21.260
Okay!  Leave it to me!

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:25.180
I'll satisfy the crowd, just like Yuya did!

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:33.360
Syun Kurosaki...

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:40.800
Masumi said that he's always 
been an LDS student.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:45.420
But Kurosaki is the culprit who attacked LDS.

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:50.210
Masumi knows that and has battled 
against Kurosaki before.

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:57.580
By the time I arrived, everyone was gone.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:01.180
When I met her during the 
opening ceremonies...

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:02.760
Masumi?

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:04.560
Masumi, tell me!

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:07.860
Why is Syun Kurosaki a member of LDS?

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:10.000
What are you talking about?

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.830
He's been our teammate from the start.

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:17.080
What happened to Masumi?

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:20.040
It's like her memories were rewritten.

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:24.510
I saw what he did to LDS.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:32.320
LDS?  In that case, I'll take you on!

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:37.020
What's going on?

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:39.220
Is he the one?

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:40.990
Xyz Summon!

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:57.170
His powerful Xyz Monster hit 
us with real shockwaves.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:01.250
Sora, be careful!  Don't let your guard down!

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:03.140
Don't worry!

00:05:03.140 --> 00:05:06.220
I'm the one who'll entertain 
you this time, Yuya!

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:08.120
Expect great things!

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:15.660
We created these Pendulum 
Cards for you.  Take them.

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:19.630
You should be able to use 
them better than Sawatari.

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:21.370
I don't need them.

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:23.800
How dare you!

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:29.710
He didn't accept your generosity, President.

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.120
It's fine.

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:34.890
Let's use this situation 
to witness his true skills

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:37.950
instead of the further 
possibilities of Pendulum.

00:05:41.260 --> 00:05:44.160
It's the start of today's third match!

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:47.490
First, let's select the Field Spell!

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:52.600
The field is Neo Heartland City!

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:59.080
This is the perfect stage for two people who 
carry the future of dueling on their shoulders!

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.510
Action Field on!

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:06.200
Activate the Field Spell Neo Heartland City!

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:18.680
Heartland...

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:32.480
It's beautiful!

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:35.860
It's like we're in a sci-fi movie.

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:39.750
It's so futuristic that it gives me shivers!

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:48.200
I'd be more excited if it was 
a city made out of snacks.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:50.560
But since the crowd likes it,

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:53.600
I guess it's fine that it's 
not a city made out of snacks.

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:54.560
Right?

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:02.230
This must have pleased him.

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:04.770
What do you mean?  What's this field?

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:11.660
Just a small present to light 
the fire in his fighting spirit.

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:16.920
What's wrong?  Does your stomach hurt?

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:20.150
Are you able to duel me?

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:23.890
Instead of worrying about 
me, worry about yourself.

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:29.600
If you're really a Fusion 
user, I'll show you no mercy!

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:41.280
How interesting.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:47.510
Everyone, my entertainment 
dueling is about to begin!

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:51.540
Please cheer for me like you did for Yuya!

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:55.780
I'll cheer for you with all my might!

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:58.390
If you win, I'll let you eat 
all the pancakes you want!

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:01.440
Go go Sora!

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:06.300
Okay!  Here I go!

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:11.740
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:18.220
Huh?  C'mon, go with the flow!

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:21.500
If I say hey, you say ho!  If 
I say mountain, you say river!

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.450
It's called call and response!  Understand?

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:30.060
It's no good.

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:31.620
I'll just do it with everyone!

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:33.910
From the start!

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:37.140
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:39.030
Along with their monsters, 
they'll kick the ground...

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:40.500
...and fly through the sky!

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.970
To move around the field!

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:46.440
Witness dueling's greatest evolution!

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.310
Action!

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:49.720
Duel!

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:57.640
The call and response with 
the crowd went perfectly!

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:00.150
They're revved up for today's third match!

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:02.620
What will happen?

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:04.090
I'll go first!

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:08.320
I summon a very cute bear 
monster from my hand.

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:10.060
I summon Fluffal Bear!

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:17.740
How cute!

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:18.800
Yeah, right?

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:22.640
But next up is someone even cuter!

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:27.060
When there's a Fluffal monster on my field,

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:29.880
I can Special Summon 
these cards from my hand.

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:33.090
Cute sheep monsters that touch your heart!

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:36.760
I double Special Summon Fluffal Sheep!

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:40.240
How cute!

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:46.200
I set one card and end my turn.

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:48.500
You're up.

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:52.200
Let's have a great show for the audience!

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:56.320
A great show?

00:09:56.860 --> 00:10:01.320
In my hometown, dueling 
used to be a great show.

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:03.620
The greatest...

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:10.620
Adults and children both enjoyed 
it with all their hearts,

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:14.760
and everyone admired duelists.

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:17.800
Until that day.

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:28.280
On that day, the enemy suddenly attacked 
and turned our city into a battlefield.

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:31.510
Enemy?  Battlefield?

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:34.710
What are you talking about?

00:10:35.020 --> 00:10:37.450
He's not making any sense.

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:40.150
Come to think of it, back then...

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:43.340
This is my battlefield!

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.160
Battlefield?

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:50.130
He suddenly appeared in 
front of me and Masumi.

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:54.100
Come to think of it, what's 
Kurosaki's hometown?

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:59.340
I don't know, even though I've 
known him for a long time.

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:04.200
Sheesh, you really don't 
know how to read the crowd.

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:08.270
I summoned three cute monsters 
to get the crowd fired up,

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:09.820
but you're being a downer!

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:13.520
I said that we should have 
a great show together!

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:17.720
If I cause a boom, you have 
to come back with a bang-

00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:18.720
My turn.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:23.680
Due to the sudden turn of 
events, we were in chaos.

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:27.620
It took everything we had 
to form a makeshift defense.

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:30.470
Do you want to duel or not?

00:11:31.180 --> 00:11:36.320
I summon Raidraptor - Vanishing 
Lanius from my hand.

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:44.850
That's the monster from before!

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:46.820
Let's battle.

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:50.220
Vanishing Lanius attacks Fluffal Bear!

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:00.480
Mr. Bear!

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:04.980
I'll save it right away.

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:08.800
I flip over my trap card Fluffal Crane!

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:15.280
This card returns the Fluffal monster 
destroyed in battle back to my hand,

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:18.250
and I draw one card from my deck!

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:22.200
You have to respond quickly, right?

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:25.360
Since Raidraptor battled,

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:29.930
I can activate the spell card 
Raidraptor - Symbol from my hand.

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:34.130
I add one Raidraptor in my deck to my hand.

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:39.000
I add Raidraptor - Vanishing Lanius.

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:43.480
Due to the effect of Vanishing 
Lanius that I just summoned,

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:49.050
I can Special Summon another 
Vanishing Lanius this turn.

00:12:49.380 --> 00:12:51.780
I Special Summon it in defense position.

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:55.160
I applaud you for responding quickly.

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:59.260
But no matter how many copies of that 
monster you bring out, they're useless.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:03.060
I set one card and end my turn.

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:05.880
They each took one turn,

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:10.160
and Shiunin and Kurosaki both have 
two monsters with the same name!

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:13.520
They're off to an equal start.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:18.080
What will happen next?

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.680
Their sweaty hands grip their cards!

00:13:24.680 --> 00:13:29.690
Will the goddess of victory smile 
upon Sora Shiunin or Syun Kurosaki?

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:34.240
She's going to smile upon the one 
who entertains the crowd more!

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:36.900
I'll entertain you with everything I have!

00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:38.460
Here I go!

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:40.370
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:44.160
I summon Edge Imp Sabres from my hand.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:53.950
When it's summoned, I return one 
Fluffal monster on my field to my hand

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:58.650
and Special Summon a different 
Fluffal monster from my hand.

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:13.420
Observe as the super cute 
sheep transforms into...

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:16.500
It's Mr. Bear!

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:17.600
Bear!

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:19.280
How cute!

00:14:19.280 --> 00:14:20.840
It came back!

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:22.840
Where's the sheep?

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:25.720
The sheep is right here.

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:27.900
Since it returned to my hand,

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:34.120
its effect lets me add a certain 
card in my deck to my hand!

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:37.290
It's the spell card Polymerization!

00:14:46.580 --> 00:14:49.270
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:55.210
Whoa!  It's Yuya Sakaki's catchphrase!

00:14:56.900 --> 00:14:58.260
That guy...

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:01.300
He really likes you, Yuya.

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:08.020
You'll now witness the real 
authentic Fusion Summon!

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:12.990
What?  Is he calling LDS's Fusion a fake?

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:16.240
Here I go!  I activate it!

00:15:16.800 --> 00:15:21.330
I fuse together Edge Imp 
Sabres and Fluffal Bear!

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:25.180
Devil's claws and beast's fangs!

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:29.680
Become one and show your new power and look!

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:32.140
Fusion Summon!

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:37.150
Appear, the hair-raising beast 
that slashes everything!

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:40.040
Frightfur Bear!

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:49.900
He's from You Show School!

00:15:50.280 --> 00:15:52.870
I'm getting shivers!

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:57.880
Let's battle!  Frightfur Bear 
attacks Vanishing Lanius!

00:16:06.200 --> 00:16:07.260
He did it!

00:16:07.260 --> 00:16:09.420
He instantly took away 900 life points!

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:13.150
I didn't only take his life 
points away.  Dontcha remember?

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:18.600
Frightfur Bear has the power to 
equip the monster it destroys.

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:21.600
Oh yeah!

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:28.360
That means Vanishing Lanius's attack points 
are added to Frightfur Bear's attack points.

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:31.970
3500 attack points!

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:34.310
I'm shivering!

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:38.040
I activate the trap Raidraptor - Return.

00:16:38.340 --> 00:16:44.220
This card returns a Raidraptor that was 
destroyed in battle back to my hand.

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:52.060
It came back.

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:54.200
He had that trap ready?

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:56.660
No wonder he's in LDS.

00:16:57.040 --> 00:17:00.800
It would've been boring if you 
weren't able to survive this.

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:04.080
I set one card and end my turn.

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:08.740
The back-and-forth attacks and 
defenses make me breathless!

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:12.000
I sense that this third match 
will be an incredible game!

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:17.220
Would anyone object to me saying 
that even at this early stage?

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:21.450
That would all depend on him.

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:25.310
You said that you wouldn't show any mercy,

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:27.430
so you should get serious soon.

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:34.900
Or is it taking everything you have to 
defend yourself, so you can't take the offensive?

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:37.180
That was true at the start.

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:44.380
Against an overwhelming enemy, it took 
everything we had to protect ourselves.

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:48.160
It's starting again.

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:49.820
What's he talking about?

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:55.840
But without a resistance force, 
there was nothing we could do.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:59.290
We lost one teammate after another.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:05.620
We learned something in this hopeless battle.

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:09.500
We must win in order to live.

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:16.740
Only those who have the iron 
will to win can survive hell!

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:20.840
My turn.

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:26.150
I summon Vanishing Lanius from my hand.

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:32.440
On the turn that this card is summoned,

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:36.140
I can Special Summon Vanishing 
Lanius from my hand.

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.540
Three Vanishing Lanius?

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:46.640
This is the same as that time.

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:51.840
I overlay three Level 4 Vanishing Lanius!

00:18:55.840 --> 00:19:01.020
Hidden falcon, raise your 
sharpened claws from adversity

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:03.760
and show your wings of rebellion!

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:06.230
Xyz Summon!

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:13.140
Appear, Rank 4 Raidraptor - Rise Falcon!

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:19.140
So he's an Xyz user.

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:20.880
There's no mistake.

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:23.200
It's the same monster as before.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:26.880
It defeated LDS's Top Team.

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:31.360
How did he defeat them when 
it only has 100 attack points?

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:36.300
This is what you're like when you're serious?

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:37.690
You must be joking.

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:44.800
This monster can attack once for every 
monster that was Special Summoned to the field.

00:19:45.020 --> 00:19:50.270
Even if you can attack all my monsters, 
it only has 100 attack points.

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:52.860
You won't be confident for long.

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:55.720
You'll soon be sorry.

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:58.980
You'll learn how incredible Rise Falcon is.

00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:03.650
Be careful, Sora!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:05.720
It's dangerous!

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:09.120
I'm fine!

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:11.860
I activate Rise Falcon's effect!

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:14.230
By using one Overlay Unit,

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:21.620
it gains the total attack points of 
all your Special Summoned monsters!

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:35.710
2700 attack points?

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:38.180
It's stronger than Frightfur Bear!

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:44.520
Battle, Raidraptor - Rise Falcon!

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:49.300
Tear apart all your enemies!  
Brave Claw Revolution!

00:20:58.720 --> 00:21:00.440
The sheep!

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:18.240
It's the monster that 
blew away LDS's Top Team.

00:21:18.780 --> 00:21:21.720
There wasn't a Real Solid 
Vision System in the alley,

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:24.420
but that monster dealt real shockwaves.

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:26.720
And it just struck Sora.

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:34.560
Unbelievable!  Fluffal Sheep and Frightfur 
Bear were destroyed in a single blow!

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:46.680
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:53.320
Rise Falcon's effect now ends, so 
its attack points return to normal.

00:21:56.560 --> 00:21:59.370
What you did was interesting.

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:01.570
In that case, I'll also...

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:08.640
...become a little more serious.

00:22:31.250 --> 00:22:35.880
As long as there's a smile

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:42.660
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:47.960
I always believe

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:51.480
In my tomorrow

00:22:51.830 --> 00:22:57.080
With courageous wings
Just fly away!

00:23:00.380 --> 00:23:05.750
This duel of the soul 
(Break through the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:12.600
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:12.790 --> 00:23:19.290
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:23.360
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:49.880 --> 00:23:52.860
You're quite the entertainer yourself!

00:23:52.860 --> 00:23:57.570
Thanks for firing up the 
crowd!  They're very happy!

00:23:57.570 --> 00:24:01.660
I'm also getting excited!  This is so fun!

00:24:01.660 --> 00:24:04.660
But the fun is coming to an end.

00:24:04.930 --> 00:24:07.420
Because I'm now serious!

00:24:07.960 --> 00:24:13.420
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Merged Magical Beast vs Evolving Falcon

00:24:13.640 --> 00:24:15.930
The fun is only getting started!
